00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,040
I can see tomorrow dawning.

255
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,757
Just keep this up till the end.

256
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:05,487
There's no way she can
do this for 11 rounds.

257
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:06,920
That damn woman.

258
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:09,780
You've got the go-ahead, so do it. Хорошо.

259
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:19,540
What? Back of the head? Hey, wait.

260
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,780
That's a nut.

261
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,977
That's a nut shot.

262
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:23,707
Nope, that's not a nut shot.

263
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:29,640
What? Hey, referee!

264
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:32,040
No, die!

265
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,290
Ronco!

266
00:15:42,380 --> 00:15:43,440
Hey, Ronco!

267
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:45,680
Were you about to hit her? No.

268
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:47,354
Maybe you should stop.

269
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:49,497
Looks like she was coming in for the kill.

270
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:50,410
She was not!

271
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:51,577
Ronco can do this!

272
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:53,357
I can see pretty boys in my future!

273
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:57,437
Don't you realize she's about to be
killed for some useless petty cash?

274
00:15:57,520 --> 00:15:58,660
It's not a problem.

275
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:00,862
I won't be taking any more hits.

276
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,740
I can feel the wind.

277
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,195
The winds of Waikiki.

278
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:18,980
Are you okay?

279
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:24,440
Look at you better than worn.

280
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,031
You call yourself a maid.

281
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:27,660
I'm an oinky-doink maid.

282
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:31,800
That said cafe is full of
nothing but wannabe maids. What?

283
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:37,180
Anyone who acknowledges you as a maid
must be total crap, just like you!

284
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:54,220
Stupid bitch. Bronco!

285
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:55,640
What the hell?

286
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:59,471
Only a monkey makes the same
mistake twice, you stupid bi -

287
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,840
Stop that!

288
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,830
Get your paw off me!

289
00:17:02,913 --> 00:17:03,743
How are you feeling?

290
00:17:03,826 --> 00:17:05,180
I sincerely apologize.

291
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,837
Your hair tie is gone.

292
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:09,157
Do you have a spare one
in your paw, Tronco?

293
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,840
Oh, I have a spare one!

294
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,035
Sorry for the hassle.

295
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:20,580
Hey, what now?

296
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:23,280
Isn't this the...

297
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:28,220
So you ready to fight me now?

298
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,917
You know you can't spin
on our cafe's good name?

299
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:33,294
And think that you'll get away with it!

300
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:37,200
Because I am a maid.

301
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:56,640
Hey, this wasn't the deal!

302
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:58,487
Those damn rotten pig heads!

303
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:02,300
Oh, crap! My pancreas!
My pancreas! Come on!

304
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,120
Please lose, Bronco!

305
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:06,540
How did her deal?

306
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:09,500
Would she really be called a maid?

307
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:13,200
I was always denied cute
things from an early age.

308
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,977
That was when I discovered
the world of maid

309
00:18:18,060 --> 00:18:21,020
cafes and aspired to become a maid myself.

310
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:25,499
But the maids I envisioned in my
mind didn't reek of blood like this.

311
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:29,580
To me, they were all
brightness and sparkles.

312
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:34,720
And shining with so much
cuteness it was blinding.

313
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:37,580
So why...

314
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:43,640
Is she smiling?

315
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:48,620
But I...

316
00:18:50,740 --> 00:18:51,570
I...

317
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:53,800
You look great! Thanks.

318
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:58,400
Geez, can't you act cuter?

319
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,380
You're not cut out to be a cute cafe maid.

320
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:05,220
But I don't know how to smile.

321
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,600
I won't have it.

322
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:09,780
Look at you.

323
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:11,333
You aren't cute at all.

324
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,160
You're wrong.

325
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,580
I am cute.

326
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,360
Especially today.

327
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:21,560
Because I'm wearing this adorable
hair tie that Nagomi gave me.

328
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:32,700
If I've been against her, will
that help me acknowledge myself?

329
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:37,680
If, like her, I can call myself cute?

330
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,340
Shall we?

331
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:42,860
Mister.

332
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,680
Please, Ronco.

333
00:19:52,620 --> 00:19:53,820
Ronco!

334
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:55,640
Knock her out!

335
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,160
Ronco.

336
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:12,160
You are very cute, as are you.

337
00:20:17,100 --> 00:20:17,980
Cheburoshka.

338
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:21,840
Welcome.

339
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:23,670
What the?

340
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:27,080
Stop it! Don't do that!

341
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,940
Hey, Pancreas.

342
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,177
My spleen.

343
00:20:36,260 --> 00:20:38,060
You pieces of shit!

344
00:20:38,280 --> 00:20:39,697
Don't let those pigs out alive!

345
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:40,610
Huh?

346
00:20:40,693 --> 00:20:43,760
We found this note posted on
your office door. Miss Tyra,

347
00:20:43,940 --> 00:20:45,577
I would like to tell
you something about the

348
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:47,997
body you had me dump in
the trunk of the car.

349
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:50,977
That means our president was
here before he disappeared.

350
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:53,180
That means you must have killed him!

351
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:59,720
You two sold off your organs?

352
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:03,220
The pancreas is just decorative,
like window dressing.

353
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:05,440
So, hey, listen, guys.

354
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:09,597
Didn't that creepy Kijima guy make a
fortune off of selling premium figurines?

355
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,510
Apparently.

356
00:21:10,593 --> 00:21:11,676
That's what I heard.

357
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:14,440
Well, then, maybe we can sell this.

358
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:17,504
Well, that was all for nothing.

359
00:21:17,700 --> 00:21:21,053
We didn't even manage to pay
off any of our overdue dues.

360
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:24,357
At least you should be grateful
you got to keep all of your organs.

361
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:26,797
Bellyaching won't get
us to tomorrow, piglets.

362
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,837
Remember, striking it rich
starts one step at a time.

363
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:32,332
For starters, I got some extra pig power.

364
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:34,360
I'm Zoya.

365
00:21:34,540 --> 00:21:37,437
I'm the new maid joining
Oinkie Doink starting today.

366
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:40,720
I'll do my very best to
become a cute, adorable maid.

367
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:42,300
Hey, from yesterday!

368
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:44,304
Are you really the same person?

369
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:46,793
This cute version is the real true meat.

370
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:49,480
An actual live overseas hire?

371
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:50,920
Tyra is dead!

372
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:53,697
I got her for free in the
deal, no strings attached.

373
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:55,721
We've finally gone international!

374
00:21:58,260 --> 00:22:02,880
I'm a total novice with no knowledge
to speak of, but I'll do my very best.

375
00:22:03,220 --> 00:22:05,691
So I'm counting on you to teach me, Ranko.

376
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:08,957
It's good to have you.

377
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:11,677
I

378
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:18,760
don't

379
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:28,100
know.

380
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:47,160
Thank you.

381
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:19,797
See you

382
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:24,680
next time.

383
00:23:39,040 --> 00:23:39,870
You
